## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a compliant, auditable backup discipline for SAP HANA on EC2 in a single EU region, focusing on immutability, encryption, and automated validation rather than theoretical concepts.

## Key Concepts
- S3 Versioning and Object Lock (compliance mode)
- AWS Backup retention policies
- KMS-managed encryption
- Lambda-based integrity validation
- IAM role permissions for cross-service access

